[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17222.708, "timestamp": "04:47:02", "text": "我是从哪里弄到那东西的。那陶器"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17226.75, "timestamp": "04:47:06", "text": "就是那个东西，对吧？我 我 我 得到了很多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17239.15, "timestamp": "04:47:19", "text": "音频经常出现故障。这是。什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17262.47, "timestamp": "04:47:42", "text": "不，这种情况偶尔会发生，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17264.19, "timestamp": "04:47:44", "text": "几天"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17279.59, "timestamp": "04:47:59", "text": "直到今天，我仍然没有对这个爱好产生兴趣。"}]